Blunt weapon like a thrown rock or a mace does damage based on the 
weight and square of the velocity, because all the damage is made by 
trasfer of kinetic energy.

Thus a stone fired from a sling should do more damage than if it is just 
thrown. Maybe this should be dexterity based rather than strength based 
as the stones (rocks) are quite light weighted.

The velocity should also drop with range but at the same time give more 
range. As the code stand today slings only increase range by one, if 
I've read the code right[1]. But IMHO at the same range sling shot 
stones should do more damage than just thrown.

